    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Overview</h2><br>SteamVR Device Monitor is designed to assist review &amp; improve SteamVR tracking system stability and accuracy.<br>In 3D visualized room, You can freely fly-thru virtual environment and watch HMDs, Base Stations, Controllers and HTC Vive Trackers movement from anywhere in 3D space. And also devices and chaperone status are displayed in realtime.<br><br>Reviewing tracking environment stability and accuracy makes it easier to revise Base Stations positioning, Infrared reflection removal, etc. to achieve to meet your VR business and entertainment project requirement.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">** ATTENTION **</h2><br>This software needs to be launched on PC with SteamVR installed &amp; setted-up.",
